Answer:

SELECT * FROM EMPLOYEE WHERE DEPARTMENT_ID IN (10, 20, 30, 50);

Q15. Display the details of all employees whose salary is not equal to 5000.

Answer:

SELECT * FROM EMPLOYEE WHERE SALARY <> 5000;

